        "text_KaqjJG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>FANY. The Intelligent Companion Created for Women<br/>FANY is more than a smartwatch brand; it’s a dedicated companion that truly understands the rhythms of a woman’s life. We are committed to fostering a fashion-forward, healthy, and intelligent lifestyle tailored for women.<br/><br/>FANY’s fusion of elegance and technology has earned global recognition. Our FANY Luna Smartwatch is the proud winner of the American Good Design 2025 Gold Award and the French Design Award 2025.<br/><br/>Our factory, focusing on smart wearables, was founded in 2014. We now employ over 1,300 people , including over 300 R&D engineers , and reinvest 20% of annual revenue into R&D each year. FANY continuously drives technological progress and product refinement. <br/><br/>We champion women — over 80% of our team — as the heart of FANY, embodying vision, elegance, and creative strength that lead the way in innovation and design. <br/><br/>We walk together. Every rhythm, every spark — we share, we feel, we glow.<br/><br/>FANY, See the Vibe.</p>",
            "font_size": "f-18",
            "text_width": 1340
          }
        }
